 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;* 학생 신청 : </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012. 6. 1(금) ~ 2012. 6. 8(금) </span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">(09:00 ~ 18:00), 주말제외</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 한국장학재단 온라인(</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">www.kosaf.go.kr</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">)으로 신청 [붙임]</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- <strong><font color=\"#f15f5f\">추가신청기간이므로 2012학년도 1학기에 한국장학재단에</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#f15f5f\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 근로신청한 내역이 있는 경우는 따로 신청필요없음</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong><font color=\"#f15f5f\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [추후 부서신청기간(6월말 예정)에&nbsp;공지예정]&nbsp;</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3. 신청절차[붙임]</span></p><p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: '휴먼명조,한컴돋움'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;